⚙️ Installation & Setup
   1. Clone the repository
     Open CMD / Terminal and run:
    Bash
     git clone [https://github.com/MAXX-code-hub/Insta-Reel-Downloader-Telegram-Bot.git](https://github.com/MAXX-code-hub/Insta-Reel-Downloader-Telegram-Bot.git)
     cd Insta-Reel-Downloader-Telegram-Bot

   2. Install dependencies
     Run the following command:
     Bash
      python -m pip install -r requirements.txt

   3. Create a Telegram Bot
      1.Open Telegram and search for @BotFather.
      2.Send the command: /newbot
      3.Follow the instructions and copy the Bot Token provided by BotFather.

   4. Set the Bot Token (Environment Variable)
     Windows CMD
    DOS
     set TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=YOUR_BOT_TOKEN
     (Replace YOUR_BOT_TOKEN with your actual token. Example: set TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=123456789:ABCdef...)

🔒 Security Note: Never upload your real bot token to GitHub or share it publicly.

    5. Start the Bot
     Run the bot script:
     Bash
      python bot.py

🚀 How to Use
    1.Open your Telegram bot.
    2.Send /start.
    3.Copy a supported public Instagram URL (Reel, Post, or Story).
    4.Send the URL to the bot.
    5.Wait while the media is processed.
    6.Click the Download Media button.

